                                "sense_id": "7f15a38f-a013-31b9-b3ce-36afd85b91d8",
                                "text": "Auch Berufsverbrecher und Alkoholiker wurden zu den Untermenschen gezählt, da man diese Erscheinungen genetisch erklärte.",
                                "translation": "Career criminals and alcoholics were also counted among the untermenschen, because these phenomena were explained genetically.",
